{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 9,
  "name": {
    "ja": "混沌のサーペント",
    "en": "Serpent of Chaos",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_LEVEL",
    "level": 100,
    "maxNum": 1,
    "monster": 862,
    "dungeon": 1,
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "最後のクエストは究極のクエストで、常に達成を求められるものだ。",
          "あなたはサーペントの領域に入り込み、深く潜り、全ての元凶である",
          "サーペントを倒さねばならない。充分用心し、忍耐強く、そして幸運を。",
          "勇敢な冒険者に光あれ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "Your final quest is the ultimate quest that has always been",
          "required of you. You must enter the realm of the Serpent,",
          "travel deep, and defeat this source of all our problems.",
          "Be prepared, be patient, and good luck. May the light shine on you.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
}
